  "notes": "Source Table A-16 (Page 50) provides counts and total annual benefits for all pay-status members (Retirees, Disabled, Beneficiaries combined). The target requires Service Retirees only. The document does not publish a separate table for Service Retirees excluding Disabled and Beneficiaries. Table A-13 (Page 47) confirms the age distribution matches Table A-16. As no split is available, the combined 'Total' population is used as the best available proxy, with a note that Disabled and Beneficiaries are included. The '90 and up' bucket is split evenly across the target rows 90-94, 95-99, and 100 & over. The source values are Annual Dollars, so no annualization is needed.",
